---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import eagle from "../assets/images/hero-eagle-layer-aq2.png";
import portrait from "../assets/images/profile-placeholder.png";
---
<BaseLayout title="Profilo atleta | Arianna Milano" description="Il percorso sportivo di Arianna Milano, giovane atleta agonista di Kung Fu Sanda.">
  <main class="profile-page" id="main" data-profile-layout="editorial-essential-v3">
    <a href="/" class="profile-back" data-interactive aria-label="Torna alla Home">
      <span aria-hidden="true">←</span> Home
    </a>

    <section class="profile-hero" aria-labelledby="profile-title">
      <img class="profile-eagle" src={eagle.src} alt="" aria-hidden="true" width={eagle.width} height={eagle.height} />
      <div class="profile-hero__copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Profilo atleta · Kung Fu Sanda</p>
        <h1 id="profile-title">Crescere<br /><em>sul tatami</em></h1>
        <p class="lead">Disciplina, tecnica e determinazione. Un percorso iniziato nel 2021 e costruito allenamento dopo allenamento.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="editorial-row editorial-row--journey" aria-labelledby="journey-title">
      <figure class="editorial-visual">
        <img src={portrait.src} alt="Spazio riservato al ritratto professionale di Arianna" width={portrait.width} height={portrait.height} />
        <figcaption>Ritratto atleta</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <div class="editorial-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">01 · Il mio percorso</p>
        <h2 id="journey-title">La crescita prima del risultato.</h2>
        <p>Il mio percorso nel <strong>Kung Fu</strong> è iniziato nel 2021. Da allora ogni allenamento è diventato un’opportunità per imparare qualcosa di nuovo, migliorare e mettermi alla prova.</p>
        <p>Durante gli allenamenti affronto aspetti diversi di questa disciplina, dalla preparazione tecnica e acrobatica al <strong>Sanda</strong>, il combattimento sportivo del Kung Fu, che oggi rappresenta il cuore del mio percorso agonistico.</p>
        <p>Con il tempo ho scoperto che il Kung Fu è molto più di uno sport. Mi ha insegnato il valore della disciplina, del rispetto, dell’autocontrollo e della determinazione. Sono principi che cerco di portare con me dentro e fuori dal tatami.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="values-section" aria-labelledby="values-title">
      <div class="values-intro">
        <p class="eyebrow">02 · Valori sportivi</p>
        <h2 id="values-title">Quello che porto sul tatami.</h2>
        <p>Quattro principi essenziali. Non una lista di qualità, ma il modo in cui scelgo di affrontare ogni allenamento, ogni gara e ogni nuovo obiettivo.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="values-stage">
        <img src={eagle.src} alt="" aria-hidden="true" width={eagle.width} height={eagle.height} />
        <div class="values-grid" role="list" aria-label="Valori sportivi">
          <article role="listitem"><span>01</span><h3>Disciplina</h3><p>Essere presente, ascoltare e lavorare con continuità.</p></article>
          <article role="listitem"><span>02</span><h3>Coraggio</h3><p>Entrare sul tatami pronta ad affrontare ogni sfida.</p></article>
          <article role="listitem"><span>03</span><h3>Rispetto</h3><p>Per il maestro, la squadra, l’avversaria e le regole.</p></article>
          <article role="listitem"><span>04</span><h3>Costanza</h3><p>Crescere attraverso i piccoli miglioramenti di ogni giorno.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="objective-section" aria-labelledby="objective-title">
      <img class="objective-eagle" src={eagle.src} alt="" aria-hidden="true" width={eagle.width} height={eagle.height} />
      <div class="objective-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Obiettivo</p>
        <h2 id="objective-title">Ogni giorno,<br /><span>qualcosa in più.</span></h2>
        <p>Non considero le medaglie un punto di arrivo, ma una tappa del mio percorso. Il vero obiettivo è crescere, imparare e tornare sul tatami ogni volta con qualcosa in più rispetto al giorno precedente.</p>
        <p>Voglio continuare a crescere come atleta e come persona, affrontare competizioni sempre più importanti e rappresentare con orgoglio la mia società sportiva, dentro e fuori dal tatami.</p>
        <a href="/" data-interactive>Torna alla Home <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
:global(body){background:#050505}
.profile-page{min-height:100vh;color:var(--ivory);background:#050505;overflow:hidden}
.profile-back{position:absolute;z-index:20;top:30px;left:max(24px,calc((100vw - 1240px)/2));display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;color:rgba(247,243,235,.7);font:800 .66rem/1 var(--font-ui);letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;transition:color .2s ease}
.profile-back:hover,.profile-back:focus-visible{color:var(--gold-bright)}
.eyebrow{color:var(--gold-bright);font:800 .7rem/1.25 var(--font-ui);letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase}
.profile-hero{position:relative;min-height:72vh;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;width:min(1240px,calc(100% - 48px));margin:auto;padding:110px 0 72px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);isolation:isolate}
.profile-hero:before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 82% 30%,rgba(139,20,18,.14),transparent 44%);pointer-events:none;z-index:-1}
.profile-eagle{position:absolute;right:-4%;top:4%;width:min(52vw,680px);height:88%;object-fit:contain;object-position:right center;opacity:.28;filter:grayscale(1) contrast(1.18)}
.profile-hero__copy{position:relative;z-index:2;max-width:760px}
.profile-hero h1{margin:18px 0 24px;font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(4rem,9.4vw,8.5rem);line-height:.84;letter-spacing:-.045em;text-transform:uppercase}
.profile-hero h1 em{color:transparent;-webkit-text-stroke:1px rgba(247,243,235,.62);font-style:normal}
.lead{max-width:680px;margin:0;color:rgba(247,243,235,.74);font-size:clamp(1.05rem,2vw,1.32rem);line-height:1.65}
.editorial-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(320px,.9fr) minmax(0,1.1fr);gap:clamp(54px,8vw,108px);align-items:center;width:min(1120px,calc(100% - 48px));margin:auto;padding:92px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08)}
.editorial-visual{position:relative;margin:0;min-height:590px}
.editorial-visual:after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:16px -16px -16px 16px;border:1px solid rgba(185,134,50,.35);z-index:0}
.editorial-visual img{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:1;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;filter:grayscale(1) contrast(1.06)}
.editorial-visual figcaption{position:absolute;z-index:3;left:18px;bottom:18px;padding:8px 10px;background:rgba(5,5,5,.82);font:700 .62rem/1 var(--font-ui);letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase}
.editorial-copy h2,.values-intro h2,.objective-copy h2{font-family:var(--font-display);text-transform:uppercase;line-height:.94;letter-spacing:-.03em}
.editorial-copy h2{margin:.35em 0;font-size:clamp(2.8rem,5vw,5.1rem)}
.editorial-copy p,.values-intro p,.objective-copy p{color:rgba(247,243,235,.78);font-size:1.04rem;line-height:1.8}
.values-section{width:min(1240px,calc(100% - 48px));margin:auto;padding:96px 0 104px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08)}
.values-intro{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(280px,.9fr) minmax(320px,1.1fr);column-gap:clamp(54px,8vw,112px);align-items:end;margin-bottom:54px}
.values-intro .eyebrow{grid-column:1/-1}
.values-intro h2{margin:18px 0 0;font-size:clamp(3.1rem,6.4vw,6.8rem);max-width:760px}
.values-intro>p:last-child{margin:0 0 8px;max-width:500px}
.values-stage{position:relative;min-height:610px;padding:54px;background:#0a0908;border:1px solid rgba(185,134,50,.18);overflow:hidden;isolation:isolate}
.values-stage:after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(5,5,5,.96) 0%,rgba(5,5,5,.84) 48%,rgba(5,5,5,.26) 100%);z-index:-1}
.values-stage>img{position:absolute;z-index:-2;right:-4%;top:-6%;width:62%;height:112%;object-fit:contain;opacity:.42;filter:grayscale(1) contrast(1.25)}
.values-grid{position:relative;z-index:2;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:0;max-width:760px}
.values-grid article{min-height:235px;padding:24px 38px 30px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12)}
.values-grid article:nth-child(odd){border-right:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12)}
.values-grid article:nth-child(even){padding-left:38px}
.values-grid article:nth-last-child(-n+2){border-bottom:0}
.values-grid span{color:rgba(185,134,50,.72);font:700 .62rem/1 var(--font-ui);letter-spacing:.16em}
.values-grid h3{margin:18px 0 14px;font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(2.2rem,4vw,4rem);font-weight:500;line-height:.95;text-transform:uppercase}
.values-grid p{max-width:280px;margin:0;color:rgba(247,243,235,.65);font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.65}
.objective-section{position:relative;min-height:76vh;display:flex;align-items:center;padding:110px max(24px,calc((100vw - 1120px)/2));background:#090807;overflow:hidden;isolation:isolate}
.objective-section:after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#090807 0%,rgba(9,8,7,.9) 48%,rgba(9,8,7,.35) 100%);z-index:-1}
.objective-eagle{position:absolute;z-index:-2;right:-4%;top:-12%;width:64%;height:124%;object-fit:contain;opacity:.42;filter:grayscale(1) contrast(1.2)}
.objective-copy{position:relative;z-index:2;max-width:660px}
.objective-copy h2{margin:.3em 0;font-size:clamp(3.4rem,7vw,7rem)}
.objective-copy h2 span{color:#9f1d19}
.objective-copy a{display:inline-flex;margin-top:24px;padding:14px 18px;border:1px solid rgba(185,134,50,.55);color:var(--gold-bright);font:800 .7rem/1 var(--font-ui);letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase}
@media(max-width:760px){
.profile-back{top:22px;left:18px}
.profile-hero,.editorial-row,.values-section{width:min(100% - 36px,640px)}
.profile-hero{min-height:590px;padding:100px 0 58px}
.profile-eagle{width:96vw;right:-38%;top:4%;height:78%;opacity:.17}
.profile-hero h1{font-size:clamp(3.45rem,18vw,5.8rem)}
.editorial-row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:46px;padding:70px 0}
.editorial-visual{min-height:455px}
.editorial-copy h2{font-size:clamp(2.55rem,13vw,4.4rem)}
.values-section{padding:70px 0}
.values-intro{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:18px;margin-bottom:38px}
.values-intro h2{font-size:clamp(2.7rem,13vw,4.8rem)}
.values-stage{min-height:auto;padding:32px 24px}
.values-stage:after{background:rgba(5,5,5,.82)}
.values-stage>img{width:120%;height:100%;right:-50%;top:0;opacity:.2}
.values-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
.values-grid article,.values-grid article:nth-child(even){min-height:auto;padding:24px 0;border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12)}
.values-grid article:last-child{border-bottom:0}
.values-grid h3{font-size:clamp(2.25rem,12vw,3.6rem)}
.objective-section{min-height:680px;padding:88px 24px}
.objective-section:after{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(9,8,7,.56),#090807 62%)}
.objective-eagle{width:130%;height:76%;right:-48%;top:-8%;opacity:.24}
.objective-copy{align-self:flex-end}
.objective-copy h2{font-size:clamp(3rem,15vw,5.3rem)}
}
</style>